{
  "_about": [
    "HELD-OUT ground truth. Unlike prospectus_labels.json, this sample was drawn AFTER",
    "the detectors were finished and was never used to tune them. Nothing in the pipeline",
    "was changed in response to the numbers it produces -- that is the entire point of it.",
    "",
    "Why it exists: the main prospectus sample was used iteratively during development",
    "(measure -> find defect -> fix -> measure), which makes it a development set. Scores",
    "on a development set are optimistic by construction. This suite is the honest check.",
    "",
    "How it was drawn, verbatim and reproducible:",
    "  stratum 'random'  - random.Random(20260814).sample() over every paragraph of 25-400",
    "                      characters outside the regions already inspected during",
    "                      development (indices 715-800, 1005-1025, 4290-4335). 30 drawn.",
    "  stratum 'contact' - random.Random(7).sample() over the same pool filtered to",
    "                      paragraphs containing '@', 'Telephone', 'Contact Person' or a",
    "                      PIN-and-state pattern. 12 drawn, 2 discarded as duplicates of",
    "                      the random draw.",
    "The random draw is ~87% negatives, which is what this document actually looks like,",
    "so it measures precision well and recall thinly; the contact draw supplies the recall",
    "signal. Neither was cherry-picked -- the seeds are above and the pools are stated.",
    "",
    "Labelling policy is identical to prospectus_labels.json."
  ],
